Subject: C=US, O=DigiCert, Inc., CN=GeoTrust G2 TLS CN RSA4096 SHA256 2022 CA1
Issuer:  C=US, O=DigiCert Inc, OU=www.digicert.com, CN=DigiCert Global Root G2 (in certifi)
Valid:   2022-12-15 .. 2032-12-14
SHA-256: 05:DC:9E:DC:0F:DD:FA:97:5A:14:32:EF:80:6E:C7:80:07:8B:53:62:AD:45:AF:76:DB:15:C9:07:63:0D:B2:5D
