         (the "CA Issuers" AIA URL of the *.swsresearch.com leaf certificate)

Refresh (when the site's leaf certificate changes issuer or this one expires):
  echo | openssl s_client -connect www.swsresearch.com:443 -servername www.swsresearch.com \
    2>/dev/null | openssl x509 -noout -issuer -ext authorityInfoAccess
  curl -sS -o ca.crt <CA Issuers URL>
  openssl x509 -inform DER -in ca.crt -out ca.pem   # skip if already PEM
  then replace the certificate block below and update this header.
